@startuml RF19_Sequencia_Hype
title RF19 — Interagir socialmente com esquemas e peças\nDiagrama de sequência — da interação ao HypeScore v2: DomainEvents.HypeSignal, HypeSignalRecorder, HypeIntegrityPolicy e HypeLiveRecalc
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
participant "SocialService\nSchemeService · WardrobeService" as S
participant "Spring\n(@TransactionalEventListener\nAFTER_COMMIT)" as SP
participant "WardrobeEventListeners\nFaiPointsService" as PT
participant "HypeSignalRecorder" as HR
participant "SideEffectRunner\n(REQUIRES_NEW)" as SE
participant "HypeIntegrityPolicy" as IP
participant "RenderCachePort\n(Redis ou memória)" as RC
participant "HypeSignalDailyRepository" as SD
participant "HypeLiveRecalc" as LR
participant "HypeSnapshotService\n(HypeCalculator)" as HS
participant "HypeCache" as HC
database "MySQL" as DB

S -> SP: publishEvent HypeSignal(signal, PIECE|SCHEME, entityId, actorId, ownerId)\nLIKE_CREATED · COMMENT_CREATED · SAVE_CREATED · FAVORITE_CREATED\n· SHARE_CREATED · PIECE_REMIXED · LOOK_REMIXED · LOOK_VIEWED · PIECE_VIEWED
S -> SP: publishEvent InteractionReceived(ownerId, actorId, LIKE|COMMENT|REMIX, targetId)
note over S: DNA não gera HypeSignal (só PIECE e SCHEME têm Hype).\nRollback da ação = nenhum evento é entregue.
S -> DB: COMMIT da interação

SP -> PT: onInteraction (consigo mesmo não pontua)
PT -> DB: fai_points_ledger: LIKE_RECEIVED · COMMENT_RECEIVED · REMIX_RECEIVED

SP -> HR: onSignal(HypeSignal)
HR -> SE: run("HypeSignal", record)
SE -> HR: record(s) em transação nova
HR -> IP: weight(s, hoje em America/Sao_Paulo)
alt actorId nulo (visitante) ou entityId nulo
  IP --> HR: 0
else ator = dono e o sinal não é PIECE_USED · PIECE_IN_LOOK · LOOK_WORN
  IP --> HR: 0 (self-like farming)
else
  IP -> RC: get(hype:dedupe:{sinal}:{entidade}:{ator}:{dia})
  alt já existe
    IP --> HR: 0 (1 sinal por pessoa, item, tipo e dia)
  else
    IP -> RC: put(chave, TTL 26 h)
    IP -> DB: users.createdAt do ator
    IP --> HR: 1, ou newAccountWeight 0,5 se a conta tem menos de 7 dias
  end
end
opt peso > 0
  HR -> SD: increment(entity, signal, dia, peso)
  SD -> DB: INSERT … ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE hype_signal_daily\n(event_count + 1, weighted_count + peso)
end
note right of SE: exceção aqui só vira log:\na curtida/comentário já foi confirmada

SP -> LR: onSignal → markDirty()
note over LR: também marca sujo em PieceCreated, PieceUpdated, PieceDeleted,\nSchemeSaved, PieceWorn, DailyLookRegistered e AvailabilityChanged

loop @Scheduled a cada 30 s (live-recalc-check-ms)
  LR -> LR: tick(): sujo e 120 s desde o último recálculo?
  opt sim
    LR -> HS: recalculate()
    HS -> DB: hype_signal_daily (horizonte) · wardrobe_items · schemes · scheme_items
    HS -> HS: HypeSignalSeries + HypeCalculator → score,\ndimensões, faixa e elegibilidade pública
    HS -> DB: saveAll hype_scores · hype_score_snapshots;\napaga estado de itens arquivados
    HS -> HC: bump() — nova geração do cache
    HS ->> HS: HypeMilestone (AFTER_COMMIT → HypeMilestoneNotifier)
    alt falha
      LR -> LR: volta a marcar sujo (tenta na próxima janela)
    end
  end
end
note over HS: O job completo também roda sozinho (cron 0 20 */6 * * *).\nGET de Hype nunca recalcula: só lê hype_scores via HypeCache.
@enduml
